msgstr "Default na Graph Type"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating graphs, what Graph Type would you like preselected?"
msgstr "Kapag lumilikha ng mga graph, anong Graph Type ang nais mong paunang piliin?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "All Types"
msgstr "Lahat ng Uri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By Template/Data Query"
msgstr "Ayon sa Template/Data Query"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Management"
msgstr "Pamamahala ng Log"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Log Tail Lines"
msgstr "Default na Log Tail Lines"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default number of lines of the Kadupul log file to tail."
msgstr "Default na bilang ng mga linya ng Kadupul log file na ita-tail."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of rows per page"
msgstr "Maximum na bilang ng mga row bawat pahina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "User defined number of lines for the CLOG to tail when selecting 'All lines'."
msgstr "Bilang ng mga linyang itinakda ng user na ita-tail ng CLOG kapag pinili ang 'All lines'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Tail Refresh"
msgstr "Pag-refresh ng Dulo ng Log"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How often do you want the Kadupul log display to update?"
msgstr "Gaano kadalas mo gustong mag-update ang display ng Kadupul log?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Viewer Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Log Viewer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Exclusion Regex"
msgstr "Regex ng Pagbubukod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any strings that match this regex will be excluded from the user display.  <strong>For example, if you want to exclude all log lines that include the words 'Admin' or 'Login' you would type '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"
msgstr "Ang anumang string na tumutugma sa regex na ito ay ibubukod sa display ng user.  <strong>Halimbawa, kung nais mong ibukod ang lahat ng linya ng log na may mga salitang 'Admin' o 'Login', i-type ang '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Real-time Graphs"
msgstr "Mga Real-time Graph"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Real-time Graphing"
msgstr "I-enable ang Real-time Graphing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an option is checked, users will be able to put Kadupul into Real-time mode."
msgstr "Kapag naka-check ang isang opsyon, magagawa ng mga user na ilagay ang Kadupul sa Real-time mode."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Graph Timespan"
msgstr "Saklaw ng Oras ng Graph"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Ang timespan na nais mong makita sa default na graph."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Pinakamababang Agwat ng Pag-refresh"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Ito ang pinakamababang sinusuportahang oras sa pagitan ng mga update ng Graph.  Ginagamit din ang value na ito upang itakda ang ilang attribute ng RRDfile.  Kung mayroon kang Device na nag-ca-cache ng data at hindi nagbibigay ng realtime na mga update, maaaring kailanganin mong dagdagan ang default na Minimum Refresh Interval upang maiwasan ang paglikha ng mga Graph na may mga puwang."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cache Directory"
msgstr "Direktoryo ng Cache"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Ito ang lokasyon, sa web server, kung saan ika-cache ang mga RRDfile at PNG file.  Ang cache na ito ay pamamahalaan ng poller.  Tiyaking tama ang mga read at write permission mo sa folder na ito"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Graph Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon ng RRDtool Graph"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Watermark"
msgstr "Pasadyang Watermark"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Text placed at the bottom center of every Graph."
msgstr "Text na inilalagay sa ibabang gitna ng bawat Graph."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Date Format"
msgstr "Pasadyang Format ng Petsa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To be used when formatting |date_time| on a graph"
msgstr "Gagamitin kapag nagfo-format ng |date_time| sa isang graph"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable RRDtool Watermark"
msgstr "I-disable ang RRDtool Watermark"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Provided your RRDtool version supports it, you may disable RRDtool advertisement on your Graphs by checking this option."
msgstr "Kung sinusuportahan ito ng bersyon ng RRDtool mo, maaari mong i-disable ang advertisement ng RRDtool sa iyong mga Graph sa pamamagitan ng pag-check sa opsyon na ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Font Selection Method"
msgstr "Paraan ng Pagpili ng Font"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How do you wish fonts to be handled by default?"
msgstr "Paano mo gustong hawakan bilang default ang mga font?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/api_device.php
msgid "System"
msgstr "Sistema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Font"
msgstr "Default na Font"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Kapag hindi gumagamit ng Theme based na kontrol ng font, ang Pango font description na gagamitin para sa lahat ng Graph, tulad ng DejaVu Sans. Opsyonal, maaari mo itong iwanang blangko at kontrolin ang mga setting ng font bawat object."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Business Hours"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Simula ng Business Day"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Ang oras ng simula ng iyong business hours. Format: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Wakas ng Business Day"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Ang oras ng pagtatapos ng iyong business hours. Format: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Itago ang mga Weekend"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Ipakita lamang ang business hours tuwing weekday."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Ipakita ang business hours"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Ipakita ang business hours sa mga rrd graph."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Kulay na gagamitin para sa business hours"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Ang kulay na ipapakita para sa business hours"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Maximum na bilang ng mga araw upang ipakita ang business hours"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Pagkatapos ng bilang ng araw na ito, hindi na idaragdag sa graph ang business hours. <br/>Inirerekomenda: 62 araw"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Naka-enable ang Data Collection"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Kung nais mong ganap na ihinto ang proseso ng polling, alisan ng check ang kahon na ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Naka-enable ang SNMP Agent Support"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Kung naka-check ang opsyon na ito, pupunan ng Kadupul ang mga SNMP Agent table ng impormasyon ng device at system ng Kadupul.  Hindi nito ine-enable ang mismong SNMP Agent."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Uri ng Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take effect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Ang poller type na gagamitin.  Magkakabisa ang setting na ito sa susunod na polling interval."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Agwat ng Pag-sync ng Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Ang default na polling sync interval na gagamitin kapag lumilikha ng poller.  Makakaapekto ang setting na ito kung gaano kadalas sinusuri at ina-update ang mga remote poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Ang polling interval na ginagamit.  Makakaapekto ang setting na ito kung gaano kadalas sinusuri at ina-update ang mga RRDfile.  <strong><u>TANDAAN: Kung babaguhin mo ang value na ito, dapat mong muling punan ang poller cache.  Kapag hindi ito ginawa, maaaring mawala ang data.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Agwat ng Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ang dalas ng pagsisimula ng data collector ng Kadupul.  Maaari kang gumamit ng crontab, scheduled task (para sa windows), o ang cactid systemd service upang kontrolin ang pagpapatakbo ng data collector ng Kadupul.  Para sa mga tagubilin sa paggamit ng cactid daemon, basahin ang README.md file sa service directory."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Pagbalanse ng Karga ng Proseso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Kung pipiliin mo ang opsyon na ito, susubukan ng Kadupul na balansehin ang load ng bawat poller process sa pamamagitan ng pantay na pamamahagi ng mga poller item bawat process."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Lapad ng Debug Output"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Kung pipiliin mo ang opsyon na ito, susuriin ng Kadupul ang output na lumalampas sa kakayahan ng Kadupul na itago ito at maglalabas ng babala kapag natuklasan ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "I-disable ang increasing OID Check"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Kinokontrol ang pag-disable ng pagsusuri para sa increasing OID habang nilalakad ang OID tree."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Remote Agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Ang tagal ng oras, sa segundo, na maghihintay ang Central Kadupul web server ng tugon mula sa Remote Data Collector upang makuha ang iba't ibang impormasyon ng Device bago iwanan ang request.  Sa mga Device na nauugnay sa mga Data Collector maliban sa Central Kadupul Data Collector, dapat gamitin ang Remote Agent upang mangalap ng impormasyon ng Device."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Laki ng Fetch ng SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OIDs should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Ilang OID ang dapat ibalik bawat snmpbulkwalk request?  Para sa mga Device na may malalaking SNMP tree, ang pagdagdag sa laking ito ay magpapabuti sa re-index performance sa isang WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Limitasyon ng SNMP Get OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Ang default na maximum na bilang ng mga SNMP Get OID na ilalabas bawat snmpget request.  Para sa mga Device, kinokontrol ang setting na ito sa antas ng Device.  Dapat mo lamang gamitin ang setting na ito kapag native na ginagamit ang SNMP API ng Kadupul sa iyong mga script o plugin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Retention"
msgstr "Pagpapanatili ng Tinanggihang Sample"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Mga oras na mananatili sa pila para sa retry ang mga sample na tinanggihan ng RRDtool, halimbawa pagkatapos ng pagbabago ng schema ng data source, bago ilipat ang mga ito sa poller_output_rejected table.  Ayusin ang RRDfile, pagkatapos ay patakbuhin ang cli/replay_rejected_samples.php upang iproseso ang mga ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Limit"
msgstr "Limitasyon ng Tinanggihang Sample"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Ang pinakamaraming tinanggihang sample na maaaring panatilihin sa pila ng isang data source.  Ang mga pinakamatandang sample na lampas sa limitasyong ito ay agad na ililipat sa poller_output_rejected table."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "I-disable ang Resource Cache Replication"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Bilang default, ika-cache ng pangunahing Data Collector ng Kadupul ang buong web site at mga plugin sa isang Resource Cache.  Pagkatapos, pana-panahong ia-update ng mga Remote Data Collector ang kanilang sarili mula sa anumang update mula sa pangunahing Data Collector ng Kadupul.  Ang Resource Cache na ito ay mahalagang nagpapahintulot sa mga Remote Data Collector na mag-self upgrade.  Kung hindi mo nais gamitin ang opsyon na ito, maaari mo itong i-disable gamit ang setting na ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Karagdagang Setting ng Data Collector"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Pag-log ng Di-wastong Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Paano mo gustong i-log ang mga error ng output ng Data Collector?  Kasama sa mga opsyon ang: 'Detalyado' na naglalahad ng bawat error, 'Buod' na nagbibigay ng bilang ng mga output error bawat Device, at 'Wala', na hindi nagbibigay ng bilang ng error."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Buod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Detalyado"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Bilang ng mga PHP Script Server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga sabayang script server process na patatakbuhin bawat spine process.  Tinatanggap ang mga setting mula 1 hanggang 15.  Makakatulong ang parameter na ito kung nagpapatakbo ka ng ilang thread at script server script at balido lamang para sa spine Data Collector."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Script at Script Server Timeout Value"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ang maximum na oras na maghihintay ang spine sa pagkumpleto ng isang script.  Ang timeout value na ito ay nasa segundo at balido lamang para sa spine Data Collector."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Pana-panahong Re-Index ng Lahat ng Device"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Iskedyul ng Re-Index ng Lahat ng Device"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Gaano kadalas mo nais i-Re-Index ang lahat ng Device.  Mangyayari ang Re-Index na ito sa hatinggabi sa dalas na pipiliin mo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Lingguhan tuwing Linggo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Buwanan tuwing Linggo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Background Timeout at Concurrent Process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Paglikha ng Report"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ang maximum na tagal na maaaring tumakbo ang Reports Generation script ng Kadupul nang hindi nagdudulot ng timeout error at pinapatay."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s Minuto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Istatistika ng Data Source"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ang maximum na tagal na maaaring tumakbo ang script ng Istatistika ng Data Source ng Kadupul nang hindi nagdudulot ng timeout error at pinapatay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ang maximum na tagal na maaaring tumakbo ang RRDfile check script ng Kadupul nang hindi nagdudulot ng timeout error at pinapatay."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s Oras"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng mga Command ng Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Ang maximum na tagal na maaaring tumakbo ang Background Commands script ng Kadupul nang hindi nagdudulot ng timeout error at pinapatay.  Isasagawa ng script na ito ang mga gawain tulad ng pag-re-index ng mga Device at pag-prune ng mga device mula sa mga Remote Data Collector."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Mga Sabay-sabay na Proseso ng Command ng Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  There will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga sabayang Poller Command process.  Hindi hihigit sa isang sabayang command bawat host sa loob ng Poller Command pool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Proseso"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Paglikha sa Background ng Maintenance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ang maximum na tagal na maaaring tumakbo ang Maintenance script ng Kadupul nang hindi nagdudulot ng timeout error at pinapatay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Paglikha sa Background ng Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ang maximum na tagal na maaaring tumakbo ang Spikekill script ng Kadupul nang hindi nagdudulot ng timeout error at pinapatay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Mga Default ng Data Collector"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ang mga setting na ito ay pinapanatili sa antas ng Data Collector.  Ang mga value dito ay mga default lamang na ginagamit kapag unang lumilikha ng Data Collector."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Mga Process ng Data Collector"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Ang default na bilang ng mga sabayang process na isasagawa bawat Data Collector.  TANDAAN: Simula sa Kadupul 1.2, pinapanatili ang setting na ito sa Data Collector.  Sa hinaharap, preset na lamang ng Data Collector ang value na ito.  Ang paggamit ng mas mataas na numero kapag gumagamit ng cmd.php ay magpapabuti ng performance.  Ang mga pagpapabuti ng performance sa Spine ay pinakamainam na malutas gamit ang threads parameter.  Kapag gumagamit ng Spine, inirerekomenda namin ang mas mababang numero at paggamit na lang ng mga thread.  Kapag gumagamit ng cmd.php, huwag lumampas sa 2x ng bilang ng mga CPU core."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Mga Thread bawat Process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ang Default na Threads na pinapayagan bawat process.  TANDAAN: Simula sa Kadupul 1.2+, pinapanatili ang setting na ito sa Data Collector, at ito ay Preset lamang.  Ang paggamit ng mas mataas na numero kapag gumagamit ng Spine ay magpapabuti ng performance.  Gayunpaman, tiyaking mayroon kang sapat na MySQL/MariaDB connection upang masuportahan ang sumusunod na equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Dapat mo ring tiyakin na mayroon kang sapat na natitirang connection para sa mga user login connection."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Paraan ng Authentication"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Ang Kadupul ang humahawak ng user authentication, na nagpapahintulot sa iyong lumikha ng mga user at bigyan sila ng karapatan sa iba't ibang bahagi ng Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Ang web server ang humahawak ng authentication. Maaaring idagdag o awtomatikong likhain ang mga user sa unang pag-login kung natukoy ang Template User, kung hindi ay gagamitin ang tinukoy na guest permission.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Pinapahintulutan ang authentication laban sa isang LDAP server. Awtomatikong lilikhain ang mga user sa unang pag-login kung natukoy ang Template User, kung hindi ay gagamitin ang tinukoy na guest permission.  Kung hindi naka-enable ang LDAP module ng PHP, hindi lalabas ang LDAP Authentication bilang mapipiling opsyon.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Pinapahintulutan ang mga administrator na suportahan ang maraming magkakaibang group mula sa iba't ibang LDAP/AD directory upang ma-access ang mga resource ng Kadupul.  Tulad ng LDAP Authentication, kinakailangan ang PHP LDAP module upang magamit ang paraang ito.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Suportahan ang mga Authentication Cookie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Kung nag-authenticate ang isang user at pinili ang 'Keep me signed in', lilikha ng authentication cookie sa computer ng user na magpapahintulot sa user na manatiling naka-log in.  Mag-e-expire ang authentication cookie pagkatapos ng 90 araw na hindi paggamit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Mga Espesyal na User"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Pangunahing Admin"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Ang pangalan ng pangunahing administrative account na awtomatikong tatanggap ng mga Email kapag nagkaproblema ang Kadupul system.  Upang matanggap ang mga Email na ito, tiyaking tama ang iyong mga setting ng mail, at may nakatakdang Email address ang administrative account."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Walang User"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Panauhing User"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Ang pangalan ng guest user para sa pagtingin ng mga graph; 'No User' bilang default."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Template ng User"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Ang pangalan ng user na gagamitin ng Kadupul bilang template para sa mga bagong Web Basic at LDAP user; 'guest' bilang default.  Idi-disable ang pag-log in ng user account na ito kapag napili."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Basic Authentication"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Mensahe ng Basic Auth Login Failure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Kapag gumagamit ng basic authentication, kung may problema sa pag-map ng username sa valid na Kadupul account, ipapakita sa mga user ang mensaheng nakalagay rito.  Maaari itong maglaman ng text at HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Mapfile ng Basic Auth"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Kapag gumagamit ng basic authentication, kung kailangang isalin ang basic account sa ibang login account, maaari kang tumukoy rito ng CSV file upang i-map ang basic account sa nais na login account."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan sa Complexity ng Local Account"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimum na Haba"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ito ang pinakamababang haba ng mga pinapayagang password."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Kailanganin ang Mix Case"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Kakailanganin nito na maglaman ang mga bagong password ng parehong lower-case at upper-case na character."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Kailanganin ang Numero"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Kakailanganin nito na maglaman ang mga bagong password ng hindi bababa sa 1 numerical na character."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Kailanganin ang Special Character"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Kakailanganin nito na maglaman ang mga bagong password ng hindi bababa sa 1 special character."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Ipilit ang Complexity sa mga Lumang Password"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Kakailanganin nito na matugunan din ng lahat ng lumang password ang mga bagong kinakailangan sa complexity sa pag-login.  Kung hindi natugunan, ipipilit nito ang pagpapalit ng password."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "I-expire ang mga Hindi Aktibong Account"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Ito ang maximum na bilang ng mga araw bago i-disable ang mga hindi aktibong account.  Hindi kasama ang Admin account sa patakarang ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "I-expire ang Password"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Ito ang maximum na bilang ng mga araw bago itakdang mag-expire ang isang password."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Kasaysayan ng Password"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Tandaan ang bilang na ito ng mga lumang password at huwag payagan ang muling paggamit ng mga ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 Pagbabago"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d Pagbabago"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Pag-lock ng Account"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "I-lock ang mga Account"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "I-lock ang isang account pagkatapos ng ganitong karaming bigong pagtatangka sa loob ng 1 oras."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 Pagtatangka"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d Pagtatangka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Awtomatikong Pag-unlock"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Awtomatikong ia-unlock ang isang account pagkatapos ng ganitong karaming minuto.  Kahit mailagay ang tamang password, hindi mag-a-unlock ang account hangga't hindi natutugunan ang limitasyong ito sa oras.  Max na 1440 minuto (1 Araw)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 Araw"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang Setting ng LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Mga Server"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Kadupul will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "Isang listahan ng mga DNS hostname o IP address ng mga valid na LDAP server, na pinaghihiwalay ng espasyo.  Susubukan ng Kadupul na gamitin ang mga LDAP server mula kaliwa pakanan upang i-authenticate ang isang user."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Karaniwang Port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "TCP port para sa mga komunikasyong Non-SSL kabilang ang LDAP + TLS.  Ang default ay 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "Port ng SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "TCP port para sa LDAPS para sa mga komunikasyong SSL.  Ang default ay 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Bersyon ng Protocol"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Bersyon ng Protocol na gagamitin sa pagkonekta sa server."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Koneksyon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Ang Network Connect Timeout sa segundo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Bind"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Ang Bind Timeout sa segundo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "Debug Mode ng LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Kung naka-check, magla-log ang Kadupul ng karagdagang impormasyon ng LDAP sa Kadupul log habang nagbi-Bind at naghahanap."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Pag-encrypt"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Encryption na sinusuportahan ng server. TANDAAN: Kapag gumagamit ng LDAP + TLS, dapat mong gamitin ang bersyon 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan sa TLS Certificate"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client.  Demand and Hard refuse a server whose certificate does not verify.  Never and Allow skip that check, so anyone on the network path can pose as the directory and read the passwords sent to it."
msgstr "Dapat bang i-verify ng LDAP ang mga TLS Certificate kapag natanggap ng Client.  Tinatanggihan ng Demand at Hard ang server na ang certificate ay hindi nave-verify.  Nilalaktawan ng Never at Allow ang pagsusuring iyon, kaya maaaring magpanggap na directory ang sinuman sa network path at basahin ang mga password na ipinapadala rito."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Mga Referral"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "I-enable o i-disable ang mga LDAP referral.  Kung naka-disable, maaari nitong mapabilis ang mga paghahanap."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Paraan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Mode kung saan susubukan ng cacti na mag-authenticate laban sa LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - Walang paghahanap ng Distinguished Name (DN), susubukan lamang mag-bind gamit ang ibinigay na format ng Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Susubukang hanapin ang username sa LDAP directory sa pamamagitan ng anonymous binding upang matunton ang Distinguished Name (DN) ng user.<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Susubukang hanapin ang username sa LDAP directory sa pamamagitan ng Specific Distinguished Name (DN) at Specific Password para sa binding upang matunton ang Distinguished Name (DN) ng user."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Natatanging Pangalan (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Ang syntax na \"Distinguished Name\", na naaangkop sa parehong OpenLDAP at Windows AD configuration, ay nag-aalok ng kakayahang umangkop sa pagtukoy ng pagkakakilanlan ng user. Para sa OpenLDAP, ganito ang istruktura ng format: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Nagbibigay ang Windows AD ng alternatibong syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, na karaniwang kilala bilang \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". Sa kontekstong ito, ang \"&lt;username&gt;\" ay kumakatawan sa partikular na username na ibinigay sa login prompt. Partikular itong mahalaga kapag gumagana sa \"No Searching\" mode, o kapag naka-enable ang \"Require Group Membership\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Kailanganin ang Group Membership"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Kailanganin na miyembro ng group ang user upang mag-authenticate. Dapat itakda ang mga setting ng group para gumana ito; ang pag-enable nang walang wastong setting ng group ay magdudulot ng pagkabigo ng authentication."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng LDAP Group"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Natatanging Pangalan (DN) ng Grupo"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Distinguished Name ng group na dapat kinabibilangan ng user."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Attribute ng Miyembro ng Grupo"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Tumutukoy ito sa partikular na attribute sa LDAP directory na naglalaman ng mga username ng mga miyembro ng group. Mahalagang tiyakin na tumutugma ang value ng attribute sa configuration na tinukoy sa \"Distinguished Name\" o na mahahanap ang aktwal na value ng attribute gamit ang mga setting na nakasaad sa \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Uri ng Miyembro ng Grupo"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Tinutukoy kung gumagamit ang mga user ng buong Distinguished Name o Username lamang sa tinukoy na Group Member Attribute."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Natatanging Pangalan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "Mga Specific Search Setting ng LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Base ng Paghahanap"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Search base para sa paghahanap sa LDAP directory, tulad ng <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> o <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Filter ng Paghahanap"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Search filter na gagamitin upang matunton ang user sa LDAP directory, tulad ng para sa windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> o para sa OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  Pinapalitan ang '&lt;username&gt' ng username na ibinigay sa login prompt. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Natatanging Pangalan (DN) ng Paghahanap"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Distinguished Name para sa Specific Searching binding sa LDAP directory."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Password ng Paghahanap"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Password para sa Specific Searching binding sa LDAP directory."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng LDAP CN"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Field na papalit sa Full Name kapag lumilikha ng bagong user, kinuha mula sa LDAP. (sa windows: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Field na papalit sa Email na kinuha mula sa LDAP. (sa windows: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "Pag-link ng URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Base URL ng Server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Ito ang lokasyon ng server na gagamitin para sa mga link sa Kadupul site. Dapat isama rito ang subdirectory kung hindi tumatakbo ang Kadupul mula sa root folder."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa Emailing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Abisuhan ang Primary Admin tungkol sa mga Isyu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Kadupul server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Kadupul user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Kadupul's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "Kapag nagkakaproblema ang Kadupul server, dapat bang abisuhan sa pamamagitan ng Email ang Primary Administrator?  Tinutukoy ang Kadupul user account ng Primary Administrator sa ilalim ng Authentication tab sa pahina ng mga setting ng Kadupul. Ang default ay ang 'admin' account."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Subukang Email"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Ito ay isang Email account na ginagamit sa pagpapadala ng test message upang matiyak na maayos ang lahat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Mga Mail Service"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Aling mail service ang gagamitin sa pagpapadala ng mail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "I-ping ang Mail Server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "I-ping ang Mail Server bago magpadala ng test Email?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Email Address ng Nagpadala"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ito ang Email address na lalabas na pinagmulan ng Email."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Pangalan ng Nagpadala"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ito ang aktwal na pangalan na lalabas na pinagmulan ng Email."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Pagbabalot ng Salita"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Ito ang bilang ng mga character na papayagan bago awtomatikong i-word wrap ang isang linya sa Email. (0 = Naka-disable)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Path ng Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Ito ang path sa sendmail sa iyong server. (Ginagamit lamang kung napili ang Sendmail bilang Mail Service)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "Pangalan ng Host ng SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Ito ang hostname/IP ng SMTP Server na padadalhan mo ng Email. Para sa failover, paghiwalayin ang iyong mga host gamit ang semi-colon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "Port ng SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Ang port sa SMTP Server na gagamitin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "Username ng SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Ang username na gagamitin sa pag-authenticate kapag nagpapadala sa pamamagitan ng SMTP. (Iwanang blangko kung hindi mo kailangan ng authentication.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "Password ng SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Ang password na gagamitin sa pag-authenticate kapag nagpapadala sa pamamagitan ng SMTP. (Iwanang blangko kung hindi mo kailangan ng authentication.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "Seguridad ng SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Ang paraan ng encryption na gagamitin para sa Email."

#: include/global_settings.php
