msgstr "Ang maximum na laki ng Email message kasama ang lahat ng attachment."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Kadupul Reporting"
msgstr "Poller Logging Level para sa Kadupul Reporting"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file? WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Anong antas ng detalye ang nais mong ipadala sa log file? BABALA: Ang pag-iwan sa anumang status maliban sa NONE o LOW ay maaaring mabilis na maubos ang iyong disk space."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "I-enable ang Lotus Notes (R) tweak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "I-enable ang code tweak para sa espesyal na paghawak sa mga Lotus Notes Mail Client."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Pangunahing IP Address ng DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Ilagay ang primary DNS IP Address na gagamitin para sa mga reverse lookup."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Pangalawang IP Address ng DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Ilagay ang secondary DNS IP Address na gagamitin para sa mga reverse lookup."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Kadupul uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Pakilagay ang DNS timeout sa millisecond.  Gumagamit ang Kadupul ng PHP based na DNS resolver."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng On-demand RRD Update"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "I-enable ang On-demand RRD Updating"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Kadupul?  If you disable, this change will not take effect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this setting is required to be on."
msgstr "Dapat bang i-enable ng Boost ang on demand RRD updating sa Kadupul?  Kung idi-disable mo, hindi magkakabisa ang pagbabagong ito hanggang pagkatapos ng susunod na polling cycle.  Kapag mayroon kang mga Remote Data Collector, kailangang naka-on ang setting na ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "RRD Updater sa Antas ng Sistema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Bago malinis ang RRD On-demand Update, dapat laging dumaan ang isang poller run"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Gaano Kadalas Dapat I-update ng Boost ang Lahat ng RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Kapag ine-enable mo ang boost, ina-update lamang ang iyong mga RRD file kapag hiniling ng user, o kapag lumipas ang panahong ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Bilang ng mga Boost Process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga sabayang boost process na gagamitin upang iproseso ang lahat ng RRD sa boost table."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Processing Mode"
msgstr "Mode ng Pagpoproseso ng Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Kung paano ipinamamahagi ng Boost ang mga RRD update. Ang mga Forked process ay nagsisimula ng bilang ng mga Boost process sa itaas sa bawat run. Ang mga Message queue worker ay ipinapasa ang bawat partition sa mga Messenger worker."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Forked processes"
msgstr "Mga Forked process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Message queue workers"
msgstr "Mga Message queue worker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maximum na mga Record"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Kung lumampas ang boost output table sa laking ito, sa mga record, magaganap ang isang update."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Maximum na Data Source Item Bawat Pass"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Upang i-optimize ang performance, kailangang malaman ng boost RRD updater kung ilang Data Source Item ang dapat kunin sa isang pass.  Mag-ingat na huwag itong itakda nang masyadong mataas dahil maaaring maapektuhan ang graphing performance sa mga malalaking update.  Kung makaranas ka ng pagbagal ng graphing o polling habang may update, ibaba ang numerong ito.  Ang default na value ay 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maximum na Haba ng Argument"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating system's Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Kapag nagpapadala ang boost ng mga update command sa RRDtool, hindi ito dapat lumampas sa Maximum Argument Length ng operating system.  Nag-iiba ito ayon sa operating system at kernel level.  Halimbawa: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ walang limitasyon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Memory Limit para sa Boost at Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Ang maximum na dami ng memory para sa Kadupul Poller at Boosts Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maximum na Run Time ng RRD Update Script"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log."
msgstr "Kung lumampas ang boost poller sa runtime na ito, maglalagay ng babala sa cacti log."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "I-enable ang direktang pagpuno ng poller_output_boost table"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost which results in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr "Ine-enable ang direktang pagpasok ng mga record sa poller output boost na nagreresulta sa 25% na pagbawas ng oras sa bawat poll cycle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Debug Log ng Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost poller process."
msgstr "Kung hindi blangko ang field na ito, magla-log ang Boost ng output ng RRDUpdate mula sa boost poller process."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Pag-cache ng Larawan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "I-enable ang Image Caching"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Dapat bang naka-enable ang image caching?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Lokasyon para sa mga Image File"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Tukuyin ang lokasyon kung saan ilalagay ng Boost ang iyong mga image file.  Awtomatikong ide-delete ng poller ang mga file na ito kapag nag-expire na ang mga ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Mga Istatistika ng Data Source"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "I-enable ang Koleksyon ng Istatistika ng Data Source"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Dapat bang kolektahin ang Istatistika ng Data Source para sa Kadupul system na ito?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Bilang ng mga DSStats Process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga sabayang DSStats process na gagamitin upang iproseso ang lahat ng Data Source."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Dalas ng Araw-araw na Update"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Gaano kadalas dapat i-update ang Daily Stats?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Window ng Oras-orasang Average"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Ang bilang ng magkakasunod na oras na kumakatawan sa hourly average.  Tandaan na ang masyadong mataas na setting ay maaaring magresulta sa napakalalaking memory table"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Oras ng Maintenance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Anong oras ng araw dapat i-update ang Weekly, Monthly, at Yearly na Data?  Ang format ay HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Memory Limit para sa Istatistika ng Data Source Data Collector"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Ang maximum na dami ng memory para sa Kadupul Poller at Istatistika ng Data Source Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Native Alerting"
msgstr "Native na Pag-alerto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Native Alert Evaluation"
msgstr "I-enable ang Native Alert Evaluation"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the main Data Collector evaluate alert rules after each polling cycle and send their notifications? Alert rules read the rates that Data Source Statistics collects, so Data Source Statistics Collection must also be enabled."
msgstr "Dapat bang suriin ng pangunahing Data Collector ang mga alert rule pagkatapos ng bawat polling cycle at ipadala ang kanilang mga abiso? Binabasa ng mga alert rule ang mga rate na kinokolekta ng Istatistika ng Data Source, kaya dapat ding naka-enable ang Koleksyon ng Istatistika ng Data Source."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Rules per Batch"
msgstr "Mga Alert Rule Bawat Batch"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga alert rule na sabay na binabasa at sinusuri. Sinusuri ang time budget sa pagitan ng mga batch."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Rules"
msgstr "%d Rule"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Evaluation Time Budget"
msgstr "Badyet ng Oras sa Pagsusuri ng Alerto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long one evaluation run may start new batches of rules. Sending queued notifications follows evaluation with the time left, and may send one batch even when the budget is spent. Rules not reached are evaluated first by the next run."
msgstr "Gaano katagal maaaring magsimula ng mga bagong batch ng rule ang isang evaluation run. Sumusunod ang pagpapadala ng mga naka-queue na abiso pagkatapos ng evaluation gamit ang natitirang oras, at maaaring magpadala ng isang batch kahit naubos na ang budget. Ang mga rule na hindi naabot ay susuriin muna sa susunod na run."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Pagsusuri ng RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "I-enable ang RRDfile Check"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Dapat bang naka-enable ang RRDfile check para sa Kadupul system na ito?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Bilang ng mga RRDfile Check Process"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga sabayang RRDfile check process na gagamitin upang iproseso ang lahat ng rrd file."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Dalas ng Pagsusuri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should RRD be checked?"
msgstr "Gaano kadalas dapat suriin ang RRD?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Data Storage"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Piliin kung ang mga RRD ay iimbak nang local o hahawakan ng isang external na RRDtool proxy server."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "Proxy Server ng RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Istruktura ng mga Path ng RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "I-enable ang Structured Paths"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each host's RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Gumamit ng hiwalay na subfolder para sa mga RRD file ng bawat host.  Ang pagpapangalan ng mga RRDfile ay isa sa mga sumusunod:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Maaari mong gawin ang pagbabagong ito pagkatapos ng install sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng CLI script na <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> pagkatapos mong gawin ang pagbabago.  TANDAAN: Kung babaguhin mo ang value ng Max Directories upang bawasan ang bilang ng mga directory, o kung babaguhin mo ang Directory Pattern, hindi ipe-prune ang mga walang laman na directory pagkatapos mong muling patakbuhin ang <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Pattern ng Direktoryo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths?  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Aling Directory Pattern ang nais mong gamitin para sa Structured RRD Paths?  Ang 'Device ID' ang default.  Ang setting na 'Device ID/Data Query ID' ay dapat gamitin kapag mayroon kang mga Device na may libu-libong Graph.  Pagkatapos baguhin ang Directory Pattern, dapat mong muling patakbuhin ang Structured Path CLI script upang baguhin ang mga path ng RRDfile sa bagong Pattern."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "ID ng Device"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "ID ng Device/ID ng Data Query"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Hash ng Device/ID ng Device"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Hash ng Device/ID ng Device/ID ng Data Query"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Max na Device Hash Directory"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device IDs."
msgstr "Ang maximum na bilang ng mga Device Directory na lilikhain batay sa mga hashed na Device ID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Server na Proxy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Ang DNS hostname o IP address ng RRDtool proxy server."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Numero ng Port ng Proxy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP port para sa naka-encrypt na komunikasyon."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "Fingerprint ng RSA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ang fingerprint ng kasalukuyang public RSA key na ginagamit ng proxy. Kinakailangan ito upang makapagtatag ng pinagkakatiwalaang koneksyon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Proxy Server ng RRDtool - Backup"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Pagbabalanse ng Karga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Kung parehong makakatanggap ang pangunahin at backup na proxy, pinapayagan ng opsyon na ito na ipamahagi ang lahat ng request laban sa RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Ang DNS hostname o IP address ng RRDtool backup proxy server kung tumatakbo ang proxy sa MSR mode."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP port para sa naka-encrypt na komunikasyon sa backup proxy."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ang fingerprint ng kasalukuyang public RSA key na ginagamit ng backup proxy. Kinakailangan ito upang makapagtatag ng pinagkakatiwalaang koneksyon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Spike Kill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Paraan ng Pag-alis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "May dalawang paraan ng pag-alis.  Ang una, Standard Deviation, ay aalisin ang anumang sample na X bilang ng standard deviation ang layo mula sa average ng mga sample.  Ang ikalawang paraan, Variance, ay aalisin ang anumang sample na X% na higit sa Variance average.  Isinasaalang-alang ng Variance method ang tiyak na bilang ng mga 'outlier'.  Ang mga iyon ay pambihirang sample, tulad ng spike, na kailangang ibukod sa pagkalkula ng Variance Average."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Karaniwang Paglihis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Batay sa Variance na may Inalis na mga Outlier"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Paraan ng Pagpapalit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "May tatlong paraan ng pagpapalit.  Ang unang paraan ay pinapalitan ang spike ng average ng data source na pinag-uusapan.  Ang ikalawang paraan ay pinapalitan ang spike ng 'NaN'.  Ang huli ay pinapalitan ang spike ng huling natagpuang kilalang magandang value."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Karaniwan"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaNs"
msgstr "Mga NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Huling Kilalang Maayos"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Bilang ng mga Standard Deviation"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Ang anumang value na ganito karaming standard deviation sa itaas ng average ay ibubukod.  Ang magandang numero ay nakadepende sa uri ng data na gagamitan.  Inirerekomenda namin ang numerong hindi bababa sa 5 Standard Deviation."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Standard Deviation"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Porsyento ng Pagkakaiba"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Kumakatawan ang value na ito sa porsyento sa itaas ng adjusted sample average kapag naalis na ang mga outlier mula sa sample.  Halimbawa, ang Variance Percentage na 100%% sa adjusted average na 50 ay aalisin ang anumang sample na lampas sa dami na 100 mula sa graph."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Bilang ng Outlier ng Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples that will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Kumakatawan ang value na ito sa bilang ng mataas at mababang average na sample na aalisin mula sa sample set bago kalkulahin ang Variance Average.  Kung pipili ka ng outlier value na 5, aalisin ang parehong nangungunang 5 at pinakamababang 5 average."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d Mataas/Mababang Sample"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Max Kills Bawat RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Kumakatawan ang value na ito sa maximum na bilang ng mga spike na aalisin mula sa isang Graph RRA."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "%d Spike"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Backup Directory"
msgstr "Backup Directory ng RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Kung hindi walang laman ang directory na ito, iba-back up ang iyong orihinal na mga RRDfile sa lokasyong ito."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Mga Setting ng Batch Spike Kill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Iskedyul ng Pag-alis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select the frequency below."
msgstr "Nais mo bang pana-panahong alisin ang mga spike mula sa iyong mga graph?  Kung oo, piliin ang dalas sa ibaba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Once a Day"
msgstr "Isang Beses Bawat Araw"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Every Other Day"
msgstr "Tuwing Ikalawang Araw"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base Time"
msgstr "Batayang Oras"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for Spike removal to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the batch removal would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Ang Base Time kung kailan magaganap ang pag-alis ng Spike.  Halimbawa, kung gagamitin mo ang '12:00am' at pipiliin mo ang minsan bawat araw, magsisimula ang batch removal nang humigit-kumulang hatinggabi araw-araw."

