msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Configuration ng Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Kadupul Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Kadupul database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Hindi isinama sa iyong config.php file ang impormasyon ng iyong Remote Kadupul Poller.  Pakisuri ang config.php.dist, at itakda ang mga variable: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, atbp.  Dapat itakda ang mga variable na ito at ituro pabalik sa iyong Primary Kadupul database server.  Itama ito at subukang muli."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Mga Variable ng Remote Poller"

