#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Kadupul server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Kadupul database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Mahalagang makapag-ugnayan ang Central Kadupul server sa bawat remote na Kadupul database server sa pamamagitan ng MySQL.  Kapag tapos na ang pag-install, dapat mong i-edit ang Remote Data Collector at tiyaking tama ang mga setting.  Maaari mong beripikahin gamit ang 'Subukan ang Koneksyon' habang ine-edit ang Remote Data Collector."

