#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collector's Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump its Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>TANDAAN:</strong> Naka-login ka sa isang Remote Data Collector.  Kapag <b>'online'</b>, makakapagtingin at makokontrol mo ang karamihan sa Main Kadupul Web Site na parang naka-login ka rito.  Mahalaga ring tandaan na kinakailangang gamitin ng mga Remote Data Collector ang tampok na <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> ng Performance Boosting Services ng Kadupul, at lagi naming inirerekomendang gamitin ang Spine.  Kapag <b>'offline'</b> ang Remote Data Collector, mas kaunti ang impormasyong laman ng Web Site ng Remote Data Collector.  Gayunpaman, ika-cache nito ang lahat ng update hanggang maabot ang Main Kadupul Database at Web Server.  Pagkatapos ay ibabalik nito ang output ng Boost table nito sa Main Kadupul Database para sa pag-update."

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>TANDAAN:</strong> Wala pa sa mga Core Kadupul Plugin, hanggang ngayon, ang muling dinisenyo upang gumana sa mga Remote Data Collector.  Samakatuwid, ang mga Plugin gaya ng MacTrack, at HMIB, na nangangailangan ng direktang access sa mga device ay hindi gagana sa mga Remote Data Collector sa ngayon.  Gayunpaman, gagana ang mga plugin gaya ng Thold basta nasa <b>'online'</b> mode ang Remote Data Collector."

